Consider the following class and client code:

```java
public class Beacon {
    private int signal;

    public Beacon(int initialSignal) {
        signal = initialSignal;
    }

    private int limit(int value) {
        if (value < 0) {
            return 0;
        }
        if (value > 5) {
            return 5;
        }
        return value;
    }

    public void boost(int amount) {
        signal = limit(signal + amount);
    }

    public int getSignal() {
        return signal;
    }
}
```

